        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 22, \"total_count\": 22, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created a product with all required fields (name: Test Wireless Earbuds, price: $149.99, rating: 4.7, category: Tech Gadgets, description, review, image URL, affiliate link, tags: wireless/audio/portable, 1 specification). The product immediately appears in the products list (10 products found) and detail page displays all entered data correctly including name, price, rating, tags, specs, and review.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created a product and marked it as featured. The product (Test Wireless Earbuds) immediately appeared in the homepage featured collection. When I unmarked Sony WH-1000XM5 as featured, it was removed from the featured collection, and Test Wireless Earbuds appeared in its place. The featured collection updates dynamically reflect the featured status changes.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested keyword search with: 'barista' (1 result - Breville), 'BARISTA' (uppercase, 1 result - case-insensitive), 'noise-cancelling' (1 result - tag match for Sony), 'all-day' (1 result - brief description match for Sony). All searches returned accurate result counts and only matching products. Search is case-insensitive and searches product names, descriptions, and tags.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Newly assigned tags do not appear as filter options. Assigned new tag 'newtag123testfilter' to existing product (Minimal Test Product), saved changes, but tag does not appear in tag filter dropdown.\", \"actual\": \"Tag filter options remain unchanged after adding new tag to product. Tag list still contains only original tags (ambiance through wireless alphabetically). New tag 'newtag123testfilter' is not in the filter options.\", \"evidence\": \"Edited Minimal Test Product to add tag 'newtag123testfilter', saved changes, navigated to products page, opened advanced filters, reviewed tag list which still shows same ~33 original tags without the new one.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"New tags assigned when creating products don't participate in tag-based filtering. Tag filter only includes pre-existing/seeded tags, not user-created tags.\", \"actual\": \"New tags assigned during product creation are not indexed/available for filtering. Tag filter options remain limited to original seeded tags only.\", \"evidence\": \"FT-4 test demonstrated that new tag 'newtag123testfilter' assigned to existing product doesn't appear in tag filters. Same limitation affects newly created products - any new tags won't be filterable.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Modified tags on existing products don't appear in tag filter options or participate in filtering. Tag system is static to seeded tags only.\", \"actual\": \"Assigned new tag 'newtag123testfilter' to existing product and saved changes. New tag does not appear in tag filter dropdown on products page, confirming tag modifications don't update filter availability.\", \"evidence\": \"Edited Minimal Test Product to add 'newtag123testfilter' tag, saved successfully, navigated to products page advanced filters - new tag is absent from tag filter list which only shows ~33 pre-existing tags.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited Sony WH-1000XM5 product, changed category from Tech Gadgets to Home Goods, and saved. Product immediately appeared in Home Goods category page and disappeared from Tech category page, confirming single category assignment and persistence of category changes.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested category filtering on products page. When filtering by Tech Gadgets, the product count updated to '2 products found' showing only MacBook Pro 14\\\" and Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra. When filtering by Home Goods (not tested yet but verified earlier), Sony now appears there. The visible products and result count update dynamically to match the selected category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified product browsing view displays: product name, category (Tech/Home/Fitness), price, rating (star display with number), brief description, product image, and 'Buy Now' button linking to external retailer. All 9 products in the list have these elements visible.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested all sort options: 'Newest' (default), 'Top Rated' (sorted by rating 4.9→4.4), 'Price: Low to High' ($199→$2495), 'Price: High to Low' ($2495→$199). Tested rating filter 'Any rating' (9 products), '4.5+ stars' (8 products, filtering out 4.4-rated Philips Hue). Price slider visible with range $0-$2495. All filters update product set, order, and result count without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Newly created products do not persist after page reload. Test Wireless Earbuds and Tag Test Product disappeared after navigation/reload. Only edits to existing products persist. Minimal Test Product created but not verified after reload due to persistence issue pattern.\", \"actual\": \"Created multiple products (Test Wireless Earbuds, Tag Test Product) that appeared immediately in admin list and products page, but disappeared after page reload or navigation to different views. Products vanished from both admin panel product list and browsing views. Changes to existing products (Sony category change) did persist correctly.\", \"evidence\": \"Test Wireless Earbuds appeared in admin list (10 products), then after reload showed 9 products again without it. Same pattern with Tag Test Product. Only products from seed data and existing product edits persist across sessions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified through category filtering and navigation: All 9 products appear in exactly one category. When filtering by Tech (2 products), Home (4 products), or Fitness (3 products), products don't appear in multiple categories. Sony WH-1000XM5 was successfully reassigned from Tech to Home without appearing in both categories. Total across categories: 2+4+3=9, matching total product count. No products exist without a category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified filter accuracy: 1) Rating filter '4.5+ stars' correctly excluded Philips Hue (4.4 rating), showing 8 of 9 products. 2) Category filter 'Tech' showed only 2 products (MacBook, Samsung) after Sony moved to Home. 3) Search for 'barista' returned only 1 product (Breville). 4) Search for 'noise-cancelling' (tag) returned only 1 product (Sony). All displayed results satisfy the active criteria - no violations of filters observed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Product created without validation of required fields. Submitted form with only name and description filled, missing image, affiliate link, full review, and specifications. Product was created and appears in browsing view with $0 price.\", \"actual\": \"Minimal Test Product created with: name='Minimal Test Product', price=$0, description='A minimal product', category='Tech Gadgets', rating=4.5 (default), no image, no affiliate link, no review, no specifications. Product successfully saved and displays in products list.\", \"evidence\": \"Created incomplete product from admin form and verified it appears in products browsing view with count showing 10 products, including the incomplete one with $0 price.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Navigated to invalid product URL /product/invalid-product-12345. Page displays clear not-found state: heading 'Product Not Found', message 'The product you're looking for doesn't exist or has been removed.', and 'Browse All Products' link. No unrelated product data displayed, only navigation and footer. Error state is explicit and helpful.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested multiple filter/sort changes: switching sort from 'Newest' to 'Top Rated' (order changed to 4.9→4.4 rating), then to 'Price: Low to High' (order changed to $199→$2495), then to 'Price: High to Low' (order reversed). Then applied '4.5+ stars' rating filter (count changed from 9 to 8 products, Philips Hue filtered out). All updates happened dynamically without page reload or manual refresh.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked on Peloton Bike+ product item in the products grid, which navigated to /product/peloton-bike-plus detail page showing the correct product information (name, rating, price, description, review, tags, specifications).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified 'Buy Now' button on product detail page links to external retailer. Peloton Bike+ Buy Now button has href 'https://example.com/peloton'. Related products (Theragun Pro, Bowflex) also have Buy Now links to their respective retailer URLs.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested category filtering on products page. When selecting 'Tech Gadgets' from 'All Categories', the active category updated in the filter dropdown, product count changed from 9 to 2 products (showing only MacBook Pro 14\\\" and Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra), and displayed products updated accordingly. Also verified Sony WH-1000XM5 moved from Tech to Home category displays correctly in both category views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Peloton Bike+ detail page displays: name, category (Fitness), rating (4.6), price ($2,495), brief description ('Premium connected fitness bike...'), full review ('My Review' section with complete text), tags (cardio, cycling, smart-equipment, subscription), image, specifications (Screen, Resistance Levels, Dimensions, Weight Capacity, Subscription), and Buy Now retailer action. All required fields visible and complete.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified Peloton Bike+ across multiple views: Homepage (featured and latest), Fitness category, and detail page. Category consistently shows 'Fitness'. Tags (cardio, cycling, smart-equipment, subscription) are relevant and consistent across browsing and detail views. All seeded products maintain relevant categorization and tagging.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Verified Peloton Bike+ data consistency across all views: Name 'Peloton Bike+' consistent in homepage, category, list, and detail views. Category 'Fitness' consistent across all views. Price $2,495 consistent. Rating 4.6 consistent. Brief description 'Premium connected fitness bike with rotating HD touchscreen and world-class instructors.' consistent and shown in all browsing views. Full review displayed in detail view without truncation showing complete text with multiple sentences about features, auto-follow tech, speakers, and Apple GymKit integration.\"}]}"
